      "extended",
      "cuisine-italian",
      "cuisine-asian",
      "cuisine-middle-eastern"
    ],
    "search": "One index chunk per partition (search/<id>.json). The chunk of the launch partition answers first; further chunks are fetched as the reader scrolls past its last result.",
